{"blocks":[["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/08%20Two%20Op.FM/","source-block-1199","Shape: Sets feedback, with operator 2 modulating its own phase.",["06.03.08 Two operator FM (Two Op.FM)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/08%20Two%20Op.FM/Asset/01-Two-operator-Oscillator-Model/png/","source-block-43","01 Two operator Oscillator Model",[]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/09%20Formant/","source-block-211","06.03.09 Granular formant oscillator (Formant)",[]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/09%20Formant/","source-block-262","Granular formant Oscillator Model",["06.03.09 Granular formant oscillator (Formant)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/09%20Formant/","source-block-508","Description: Granular synthesis chops a wave into tiny pieces called particles, then rearranges, multiplies, and combines them. This model rearranges particles into formants and filtered waveforms.",["06.03.09 Granular formant oscillator (Formant)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/09%20Formant/","source-block-713","Interval: Sets the frequency ratio between formants one and two.",["06.03.09 Granular formant oscillator (Formant)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/09%20Formant/","source-block-785","Formant: Sets the formant frequency.",["06.03.09 Granular formant oscillator (Formant)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/09%20Formant/","source-block-829","Shape: Sets formant width and shape by controlling the window applied to the sum of two synchronized sine oscillators.",["06.03.09 Granular formant oscillator (Formant)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/09%20Formant/Asset/01-Granular-formant-Oscillator-Model/png/","source-block-43","01 Granular formant Oscillator Model",[]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-209","06.03.10 Chords (Chords)",[]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-238","Chords Oscillator Model",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-453","Description: Chords mode turns the digital oscillator into four voices that can play and modulate chords.",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-566","The first note of a chord is its root. The third determines whether the chord is minor, three half-steps above the root, or major, four half-steps above it. Adding voices further shapes the minor or major feel.",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-780","A major chord may sound forceful and happy, while a minor chord may sound sad to listeners raised with Western music. Responses to major and minor scales differ across cultures.",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1173","Type: Selects the chord:",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1205","Octave",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1216","5th",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1224","sus4",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1233","Minor",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1243","Minor 7",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1255","Minor 9",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1267","Minor 11",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1280","6th and 9th added",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1302","Major 9",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1314","Major 7",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1326","Major",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)","Type: Selects the chord:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1336","Inv/Transp: Changes the chord inversion and frequency range. The chord stays the same, but the pitches are combined differently as the Timbre knob moves or is modulated externally.",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/","source-block-1524","Example: Hold a C major chord (C/E/G) and turn Timbre to the right. At position 10, the chord reaches its first inversion; turning further produces other inversions.",["06.03.10 Chords (Chords)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/10%20Chords/Asset/01-Chords-Oscillator-Model/png/","source-block-43","01 Chords Oscillator Model",[]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-208","06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)",[]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-257","Vowel and speech synthesis Oscillator Model",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-532","Description: The Speech oscillator draws on speech synthesis research begun by Texas Instruments in the late 1970s, which led to the Speak & Spell talking toy. Vowels use unrestricted airflow while the throat and tongue shape their sound; consonants delimit and shape vowels.",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-815","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Type",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-873","The Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave knob scans",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Type"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-931","1 - formants from 0 to about 100,",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Type","The Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave knob scans"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-974","2 - then libraries of colors,",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Type","The Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave knob scans"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1013","3 - numbers,",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Type","The Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave knob scans"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1035","4 - letters, and",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Type","The Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave knob scans"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1061","5 - words.",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Type","The Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave knob scans"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1081","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Timbre:",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1142","Shifts the speech formants up or down.",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Timbre:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1189","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Word:",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1248","The Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape knob scans subsets of words from the library selected with the Wave knob.",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Speech/Word:"]],["Microfreak/UG/06%20Dig%20Osc/03%20Types/11%20Speech/","source-block-1374","Examples",["06.03.11 Vowel and speech synthesis (Speech)"]]],"format_version":5}